 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "域名劫持",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 100.06,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "先看链路最外面的一环，域名。",
   "spoken": "先看链路最外面的一环，域名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.22
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "浏览器先问 DNS，这个域名指向哪台服务器。",
   "spoken": "浏览器先问 DNS，这个域名指向哪台服务器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 4.711,
   "speechEnd": 8.036
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "攻击者控制域名注册商的账号，或者攻破注册商本身。",
   "spoken": "攻击者控制域名注册商的账号，或者攻破注册商本身。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-02.wav",
   "start": 8.44,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 8.44,
   "speechEnd": 13.101
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "再把解析记录，指向自己的服务器。",
   "spoken": "再把解析记录，指向自己的服务器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-03.wav",
   "start": 13.54,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 13.54,
   "speechEnd": 16.111
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "你访问正确的域名，打开的却是克隆页面。",
   "spoken": "你访问正确的域名，打开的却是克隆页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-04.wav",
   "start": 16.56,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 16.56,
   "speechEnd": 19.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "回到开头的题，不能证明。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的题，不能证明。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-05.wav",
   "start": 20.38,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speechStart": 20.38,
   "speechEnd": 22.293
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "控制了解析的人，可以用常见的域名验证方式，申请到有效证书。",
   "spoken": "控制了解析的人，可以用常见的域名验证方式，申请到有效证书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-06.wav",
   "start": 22.68,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 22.775,
   "speechEnd": 28.169
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "锁标志只说明，浏览器连上了域名此刻指向的服务器。",
   "spoken": "锁标志只说明，浏览器连上了域名此刻指向的服务器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-07.wav",
   "start": 28.58,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 28.674,
   "speechEnd": 33.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "地址栏这一层的检查，在这里全部失效。",
   "spoken": "地址栏这一层的检查，在这里全部失效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-08.wav",
   "start": 34.32,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 34.42,
   "speechEnd": 37.611
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "2025 年 5 月，攻击者进入同一家注册商的系统。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 5 月，攻击者进入同一家注册商的系统。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-09.wav",
   "start": 38.06,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 38.162,
   "speechEnd": 42.794
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "又一次把 Curve 的域名委派，改到自己的服务器。",
   "spoken": "又一次把 Curve 的域名委派，改到自己的服务器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-10.wav",
   "start": 43.16,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 43.16,
   "speechEnd": 46.476
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "Curve 把用户引导到新域名，并公开批评注册商响应迟缓。",
   "spoken": "Curve 把用户引导到新域名，并公开批评注册商响应迟缓。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-11.wav",
   "start": 46.9,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 47.008,
   "speechEnd": 52.014
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "同一家注册商出两次事，说明换个强密码不够，注册商本身就是风险。",
   "spoken": "同一家注册商出两次事，说明换个强密码不够，注册商本身就是风险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-12.wav",
   "start": 52.4,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 52.4,
   "speechEnd": 58.708
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "2024 年 7 月，Google Domains 的域名业务，迁到 Squarespace。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 7 月，Google Domains 的域名业务，迁到 Squarespace。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-13.wav",
   "start": 59.1,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 59.1,
   "speechEnd": 63.147
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "之后，Compound 等多个 DeFi 项目的域名被劫持，指向盗币页面。",
   "spoken": "之后，Compound 等多个 DeFi 项目的域名被劫持，指向盗币页面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-14.wav",
   "start": 63.56,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 63.56,
   "speechEnd": 69.048
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "研究者认为，这和迁移期间多因素认证失效有关，官方没有公布根因。",
   "spoken": "研究者认为，这和迁移期间多因素认证失效有关，官方没有公布根因。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-15.wav",
   "start": 69.46,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 69.556,
   "speechEnd": 74.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "Celer 靠域名监控，拦下了劫持尝试。",
   "spoken": "Celer 靠域名监控，拦下了劫持尝试。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-16.wav",
   "start": 75.44,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 75.44,
   "speechEnd": 78.2
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "所以域名这一环，要开注册商锁和注册局锁。",
   "spoken": "所以域名这一环，要开注册商锁和注册局锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-17.wav",
   "start": 78.62,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 78.62,
   "speechEnd": 82.904
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "注册商账号用硬件密钥登录，只给少数人权限。",
   "spoken": "注册商账号用硬件密钥登录，只给少数人权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-18.wav",
   "start": 83.24,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 83.24,
   "speechEnd": 86.975
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "开启 DNSSEC，监控解析记录、委派和证书的变化。",
   "spoken": "开启 DNSSEC，监控解析记录、委派和证书的变化。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-19.wav",
   "start": 87.38,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 87.471,
   "speechEnd": 92.226
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "换服务商的当天，重新核查账号和多因素认证。",
   "spoken": "换服务商的当天，重新核查账号和多因素认证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg3-20.wav",
   "start": 92.64,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 92.64,
   "speechEnd": 96.202
  },
  {
